<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>Welcome to FakeDLN, <%= @user.first_name %>!</h1>
    <p>
      Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,
    </p>
    <p>
      Thank you for signing up for FakeDLN, the professional networking platform (that's totally not LinkedIn 😉).
    </p>
    <p>
      You've successfully created your account with the email: <strong><%= @user.email %></strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      To get started:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Complete your profile with a headline and bio</li>
      <li>Connect with other professionals</li>
      <li>Share your thoughts and insights</li>
      <li>Engage with posts from your network</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <%= link_to "Visit FakeDLN", @url %>
    </p>
    <p>
      Thanks for joining us!<br>
      The FakeDLN Team
    </p>
  </body>
</html>

